&lt;li&gt;Uncovering new and diverse use cases to enable our users to derive maximum value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating across Elastic business functions to ensure a seamless customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working thoughtfully with customers within the Defence community to identify new business opportunities, manage the sales cycle and close complex transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a robust business plan through community, customer and partner ecosystems to achieve significant Elastic growth within your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
